  {
   "id": "genopanic-204193@major-2025-06-04",
   "gameId": "genopanic-204193",
   "displayName": "MAJOR CONTENT UPDATE IS LIVE!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-04T17:00:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone! We’ve just released a massive update that expands the world of Genopanic, adds new features, and gives completionists even more reasons to dive back in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And yes — Genopanic is now available on Nintendo Switch and PlayStation, alongside PC (Steam)! 🎮",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "🔁 Backtracking is now available!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Use the brand-new pneumatic portal system to return to previously visited locations. Revisit old zones, uncover hidden paths, and chase every last secret. Perfect for explorers and achievement hunters!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "💎 Collect belomorium crystals to boost your health",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new collectible has entered the lab — belomorium crystals. Each one increases your max health, helping you survive deeper into the facility and tougher encounters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧬 Unlock the best ending by completing the game 100%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Find all GMOs and crystals, and you’ll unlock a brand-new ending. More story, more revelations — no spoilers, but it’s definitely worth it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎬 More cutscenes, new lore, and extra dialogues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've added fresh cutscenes, character interactions, and in-world notes to make the story more immersive and the lab even weirder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠 Tons of fixes and polish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug fixes across multiple zones;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Better performance and stability;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Smoothed animations and platforming.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for all your support — and don’t forget: you can now play Genopanic on console too!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
