  {
   "id": "genopanic-204193@major-2023-06-19",
   "gameId": "genopanic-204193",
   "displayName": "Demo big update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-19T14:59:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello, astronauts!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Our team has made significant improvements to the core elements of the game and is ready to present a new demo version. The list provided below will introduce you to the coolest changes that will make your adventure even more fun and thrilling.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game's main menu has become even more beautiful, convenient, and intuitive. Now, even in low-gravity conditions, you can easily and quickly find the item you need.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "An interface has been added for the portable assistant P.E.S. (OS). It provides instant access to inventory, task list, message list, and the space station mini-map. We wanted to add the ability to listen to music and watch TV shows, but thought that you might get distracted and lost.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Significant improvements have been made to the sound design. The sounds of locations, various types of weapons, and equipment have become more realistic for total immersion. We are sure that the updated enemy shrieks and character voices will not leave anyone indifferent.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Speaking of characters, get ready to meet VOLGA - a bold and mischievous artificial intelligence of the space station that… ahem… will introduce you to the first dangerous boss - the loader robot KAMA.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For those who love to search for secret rooms, there's a pleasant surprise - a fog of war that disappears with a mystical sound as you enter the room. But be careful, as the fog may hide not only rewards but dangers too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Another interesting addition is the developers' room. This is a bonus location where you can go through a real training simulation, test different types of weapons and equipment for passing laboratory tests. Try to collect all the hidden crystals.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please read the new messages carefully. You will encounter them in the most unexpected places. They will gradually reveal the mystery of what's happening on the station and introduce you to the game world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We must also mention that LAIK is now more emotional. He will be joyful, angry, and even scared, depending on the events around him. Don't scold him if he acts smart during training - it's just his character. In reality, he's cute and you'll befriend him.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chongus will reappear in the game and Monkat will flash by several times. You ask who they are? We won't answer, will just smile mysteriously, and suggest you play to find the answers to all your questions yourself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The bug clean-up is ongoing. The old bugs have been squashed and, to our knowledge, no new ones have snuck in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rejoice, controller users! The game is now more convenient for you, with control tips matched to your controller buttons. Now, both handheld and console play are a breeze.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ultra-wide monitor users, we've got you covered! Enjoy a wider, more immersive experience with our new support feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "And good news for Steamdeck users, we now support this platform as well! Get ready for an optimized experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope that you will get the most out of the game. We look forward to your feedback on social media.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
